OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith plenty of clear skies across the
OL,7,Fregion tonight. Temperatures a little
OL,8,Flower than of late, leading to a more
OL,9,Fcomfortable night for most. Breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FRemaining largely dry with
OL,12,Fspells of sunshine, although the
OL,13,Fsunshine maybe rather hazy at times.
OL,14,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,15,FAugust but again much cooler than of
OL,16,Flate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
