OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry and bright on Friday and Saturday
OL,7,Fwith temperatures also trending
OL,8,Fupwards again. A very small risk of
OL,9,Fsome showers on Sunday but staying dry
OL,10,Fand warm for most.
